program	errors/unsafe_sync_already_derives.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	`Plain` already derives `Sync`, so `UnsafeSync` asserts nothing
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: `Plain` already derives `Sync`, so `UnsafeSync` asserts nothing"
log	"  --> examples/errors/unsafe_sync_already_derives.saw:12:1"
log	"     |"
log	" 12 | extension Plain: UnsafeSync {}"
log	"     | ^"
log	"   hint: delete the declaration — an assertion is only legal where the structural derivation FAILED, and reading one beside a type that derives cleanly would teach the next reader the wrong thing"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
